<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pages on Ohana</title><link>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/</link><description>Recent content in Pages on Ohana</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><managingEditor>Ohanagatsprat@gmail.com</managingEditor><webMaster>Ohanagatsprat@gmail.com</webMaster><atom:link href="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ajuda'ns</title><link>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/helpus/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Ohanagatsprat@gmail.com</author><guid>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/helpus/</guid><description>&lt;div class="row text-center help-nav"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="col-sm-3 col-xs-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#amazon" class="help-card"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/AmazonWishList-nav-2.jpeg" alt="Amazon"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;🛒 Amazon&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="col-sm-3 col-xs-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#teaming" class="help-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/Donacion-nav-1.jpeg" alt="Doanciones en plataformas"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;🤝 Teaming&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="col-sm-3 col-xs-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#material" class="help-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/DonacionMaterial-nav-1.jpeg" alt="Material"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;🎁 Material&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="col-sm-3 col-xs-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#voluntariado" class="help-card"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/Voluntariado-nav-1.jpeg" alt="Voluntariado"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;🐾 Voluntariat&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="col-sm-3 col-xs-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#new_section" class="help-card"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/AmazonWishList-nav-2.jpeg" alt="New"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;🛒 Amazon&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id="amazon"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h4 id="-la-nostra-llista-de-desitjos-damazon"&gt;🛒 La nostra llista de desitjos d&amp;rsquo;Amazon&lt;/h4&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/helpus/AmazonWishlist-1.jpeg" alt="Amazon-donacions" style="width:350px; float:left; margin-right:20px; border-radius:12px;"&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Pots formar part de la seva història des de la nostra &lt;a href="https://www.amazon.es/hz/wishlist/ls/1Y8QOAH2M4LWO?ref_=wl_share"&gt;Llista de Desitjos&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Cada producte que tries es converteix en alguna cosa que necessiten: un llit on descansar, menjar al seu bol o una joguina amb la qual tornar a ser feliços.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Contacto</title><link>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/contact/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Ohanagatsprat@gmail.com</author><guid>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/contact/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Vols posar-te en contacte amb nosaltres?&#10;Omple el formulari i el teu humà‑mail s’obrirà automàticament. De vegades, una nova història comença amb un gest senzill&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;🐾 Abans d’escriure’ns, explica’ns una mica sobre tu i sobre la llar que imagines per a un dels nostres gatets.&#10;Conèixer el teu entorn i les teves expectatives ens ajuda a assegurar-nos que cada petit trobi un lloc on créixer, sentir-se protegit i crear un vincle per a tota la vida 💛&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sobre OHANA</title><link>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Ohanagatsprat@gmail.com</author><guid>https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/ca/page/about/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="-així-va-néixer-la-nostra-família"&gt;🐾 &lt;strong&gt;Així va néixer la nostra família&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="about-carousel"&gt;&lt;div class="about-carousel__slide is-active"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/about/foto2_.jpeg"&#10; alt="OHANA"&#10; &#10; loading="eager"&#10; fetchpriority="high"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="about-carousel__slide"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img&#10; src="https://diacoro926.github.io/ohana-gats-web/img/about/foto_1.jpeg"&#10; alt="OHANA"&#10; &#10; loading="lazy"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10;(function () {&#10;&#10; function initAboutCarousel(carousel) {&#10;&#10; const slides =&#10; carousel.querySelectorAll(".about-carousel__slide");&#10;&#10; if (slides.length &lt;= 1) {&#10; return;&#10; }&#10;&#10; let current = 0;&#10; const interval = 5000;&#10;&#10; function showNextSlide() {&#10;&#10; slides[current].classList.remove("is-active");&#10;&#10; current = (current + 1) % slides.length;&#10;&#10; slides[current].classList.add("is-active");&#10; }&#10;&#10; let timer = setInterval(showNextSlide, interval);&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; carousel.addEventListener("mouseenter", function () {&#10; clearInterval(timer);&#10; });&#10;&#10; carousel.addEventListener("mouseleave", function () {&#10; timer = setInterval(showNextSlide, interval);&#10; });&#10; }&#10;&#10; document&#10; .querySelectorAll(".about-carousel")&#10; .forEach(initAboutCarousel);&#10;&#10;})();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Tot va començar amb una cosa tan senzilla com un transportí i amb molt poques persones intentant ajudar com podien.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>